Package: ooumask
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: MASK CONTROLLER
 Reads and sets the process file mode creation mask for spawned tasks.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
